message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ZDEM_DFN: Discrete Fracture Network Generator for ZDEM Discrete Element Simulations"
authors:
  - alias: Phoenix0531-sudo
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-11"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Phoenix0531-sudo/ZDEM_DFN"
keywords:
  - discrete fracture network
  - DFN
  - discrete element method
  - rock mechanics
  - fracture
  - ZDEM
abstract: >-
  A stochastic discrete fracture network (DFN) generator for ZDEM
  discrete element simulations. Generates multi-set fracture networks
  with log-normal trace lengths, per-set dip orientation and p21
  intensity, T-intersection truncation, seeded reproducibility, and
  hash-grid-accelerated particle-fracture tagging.
